# --- ADNI data: never redistributed -----------------------------------------
# ADNI's Data Use Agreement prohibits redistributing raw or derived imaging data
# (including subject-ID manifests). Nothing under data/ is ever pushed, regardless
# of size.
data/

# --- model weights ------------------------------------------------------------
# ~1GB across every experimental checkpoint from the project's history -- far too
# large for git, and none of it is needed to run the demo except the one checkpoint
# actually served (webapp/backend/tasks.py). That one IS tracked (9MB) so the repo
# is enough on its own to run the live demo -- training requires the (excluded,
# ADNI-licensed) dataset, but *serving* an already-trained model does not.
models/*
!models/checkpoints/
models/checkpoints/*
!models/checkpoints/mobilenetv2_ADvsCN.pt
*.pt
!mobilenetv2_ADvsCN.pt

# --- unpublished paper + third-party copyrighted references -------------------
# The paper drafts in report_assets/ are submitted to a conference and still under
# review; the PDFs in reference_papers/ are other authors' published work kept
# locally for citation. Neither belongs in a public repo. Code that generates the
# report (build_report*.py etc.) is fine and stays tracked.
report_assets/*.docx
report_assets/*.pdf
reference_papers/*.pdf
reports/*.docx
reports/*.pdf

# --- demo run artifacts (binary/derived, not source) ---------------------------
demo/results/*.pt
demo/results/*.npy
demo/results/*.csv

# --- disposable/aborted scratch runs, not real results -------------------------
reports/BAD_*
reports/*_adhoc_backup.*

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Node / frontend build ---------------------------------------------------
webapp/frontend/node_modules/
webapp/frontend/dist/
npm-debug.log*

# --- editor/OS ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- internal working notes, not part of the project deliverable --------------
CLAUDE.md
claudereaserch.md
